# Taylor, Cincinnatus). Drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny (region cny, which offered Homer and Cortland);
# the Atlas had nothing within 15 km of Homer. Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py,
# including the Cortland County Register list), HMdb marker pages (tools/page.py), the 1890 House Museum, Cortland
